\par}
{\tc\tcl2 \v Test Set-Up}
The test-set, which contains 62 individual tests, is tested on 3 different sequences. An overview of the test-set can be found in the Excel spreadsheet, located on the MPEG FTP server. In order to perform the test, the latest version of the LCEVC Test Model (LTM) shall be used (LTM v.5.3 at the time of writing). \par
